1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:07,439
這是頭家夥伴：一個會自己看數據、主動找問題的車隊 AI 顧問。
Meet Boss Buddy: a fleet AI advisor that reads the data and finds problems on its own.

2
00:00:09,329 --> 00:00:17,046
王老闆有 5 台 HINO 貨車，每個月油錢大約 19 萬元。
Mr. Wang runs five HINO trucks. His fuel bill is about 190,000 NT dollars a month.

3
00:00:17,136 --> 00:00:22,936
他沒空看報表。AI 每天晚上自己檢查車隊數據。
He has no time for reports. So every night, the AI checks his fleet data by itself.

4
00:00:24,026 --> 00:00:32,717
固定規則先篩出異常：ABC-6776 每天怠速 6.1 小時，同型車平均只有 2.3 小時。
Simple rules flag it first: truck 6776 idles 6.1 hours a day. Similar trucks average 2.3.

5
00:00:32,807 --> 00:00:40,994
調查員 AI 接著查：怠速集中在萬華一帶同一個停靠點，每次 5 到 8 小時沒熄火。
An investigator agent digs in: the idling happens at one stop in Wanhua, five to eight hours at a time, engine running.

6
00:00:41,084 --> 00:00:46,757
換算每個月多花約 3,000 元，AI 主動傳 LINE 給王老闆。
That's about 3,000 dollars a month. The AI messages Mr. Wang on LINE.

7
00:00:49,047 --> 00:00:54,427
王老闆回：那是冷凍車，停著也要開冷凍機，不能熄火。
Mr. Wang pushes back: it's a refrigerated truck. The engine has to stay on.

8
00:00:54,517 --> 00:00:59,424
AI 把「冷凍機必須運轉」當成限制條件，重新拆解這段怠速。
The AI takes that as a hard constraint, and breaks the idle time down again.

9
00:00:59,514 --> 00:01:06,926
數據分不出多少時間是在排隊等卸貨，所以 AI 設計了兩週的對照實驗。
The data can't tell how much of it is just waiting in line to unload. So the AI designs a two-week experiment.

10
00:01:07,016 --> 00:01:13,330
它也算給老闆看：如果冷凍機能插電待機，每月最多可省約 100 公升。
It also runs the numbers: plugging the reefer into shore power could save up to 100 liters a month.

11
00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:21,393
每週，AI 會不帶預設規則，自己在數據裡找新問題。
Every week, the AI also explores the data with no preset rules, looking for new problems.

12
00:01:21,483 --> 00:01:29,556
它先懷疑 ABC-5310 被偷油：油量讀數 1 分鐘從 55% 掉到 25%。
It first suspects fuel theft on truck 5310: the gauge fell from 55 to 25 percent in a minute.

13
00:01:29,646 --> 00:01:36,640
但反駁者發現讀數馬上跳回，同期只用了 2 公升油。是感測器跳動，不打擾老闆。
But a skeptic agent sees it jump right back, with only 2 liters burned. Sensor noise, so no false alarm.

14
00:01:36,730 --> 00:01:45,893
真正的發現在 ABC-7610：濾煙器（DPF）故障碼 3 月開始出現，11 月越來越頻繁。
The real finding is truck 7610: its diesel particulate filter codes started in March, and are getting more frequent in November.

15
00:01:45,983 --> 00:01:51,662
AI 建議兩週內進 HINO 服務廠，在拋錨之前處理。
The AI suggests a HINO service visit within two weeks, before it breaks down on the road.

16
00:01:54,152 --> 00:02:01,054
兩週後實驗結果（示意）：晚一小時到場，每次少怠速將近 2 小時。
Two weeks later, the result, illustrative: arriving an hour later cuts nearly two hours of idling per stop.

17
00:02:01,144 --> 00:02:07,669
月底結算以匿名同型車為對照，扣掉季節與路況影響，並按保守下限計費。
At month end, savings are measured against anonymous peer trucks, and billed at the conservative lower bound.

18
00:02:07,759 --> 00:02:13,519
王老闆這個月淨省約 6,500 元。沒省到，就不收錢。
Mr. Wang keeps about 6,500 dollars this month. No savings, no fee.

19
00:02:16,009 --> 00:02:22,217
頭家夥伴：自己找問題、聽得懂限制，省下來才收費。
Boss Buddy finds problems on its own, respects real constraints, and only gets paid when you save.

20
00:02:22,307 --> 00:02:25,750
下一階段，同一套引擎會用在行車安全。
Next, the same engine moves on to driving safety.
